The conversion pipeline in Tools/coreml uses fair-esm (MIT), PyTorch
(BSD-3-Clause), coremltools (BSD-3-Clause) and NumPy (BSD-3-Clause). None of
these is redistributed here; they are dependencies of the build-time scripts
only, pinned in Tools/coreml/requirements.txt.

No third-party Swift package is used or vendored. The app links Apple system
frameworks (SwiftUI, SceneKit, Core ML, AVFoundation, Swift Charts) under the
terms of the Apple SDK licence.
